- Write shareable comparison HTML to `shared/{slug}.html`.
- Public URL shape: `https://mohdizzudin.github.io/shared/{slug}.html`.
- Do not place new comparison analysis HTML at the repo root unless the user explicitly asks.
- Commit and push to `master` only when the user asks to deploy, publish, push, or share.
